; The prod-lean guarantee, as a `dune runtest` guard so a regression trips CI: the served native
; server.exe must NOT link the heavy e2e/CDP test machinery (fennec-hunt's Cdp/Chrome/Http_client) or its
; yojson dep. A pure-OCaml scan reads the built binary and fails if a forbidden module name appears.
; (`fennec release` runs the same check on the artifact it ships — see cli/release/lean.ml; the two
; needle lists are kept in sync by hand so this guard stays zero-dependency.)
(executable
 (name check_lean)
 (modules check_lean))

(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (deps
  (file %{project_root}/examples/site/server.exe))
 (action
  (run %{exe:check_lean.exe} %{project_root}/examples/site/server.exe)))
